        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, hydropower, at pumped storage plant, ENTSO, 2020</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, hydropower, at pumped storage plant, ENTSO, 2020
The electricity used to run the pump storage power plant is modelled by a specific electricity mix used for the operation of storage pumps in Germany in 2018.; UUID:18d6458c-55da-3f60-b11e-16e65eaa63c4
This dataset includes the shares of different technologies of the electricity mix used for the operation of storage pumps in Germany.
Location: Germany
Technology: Average technology
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: 
Sampling: Statistics
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_18d6458c-55da-3f60-b11e-16e65eaa63c4.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
